WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:43.613 --> 00:00:46.530
- [Narrator] Chinese Kung Fu
dates back thousands of years.

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:48.591
Among the hundreds of fighting styles

00:00:48.591 --> 00:00:52.650
is an obscure technique
called body-shrinking.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.473
Practitioners trained for years
to dislocate their joints

00:00:55.473 --> 00:00:58.057
for increased flexibility.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.288
The style was almost lost to time,

00:01:00.288 --> 00:01:04.455
and Li is one of the art's
last remaining masters.

